            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SummVly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The only change I make to this recipe is with the Worcestershire Sauce; to me it has a over-powering flavor so I use one teaspoon instead of two. I've been making this recipe since the 70's -- got it from an old Kraft recipe book which I still have! :-)",
            "datePublished": "2018-10-18T16:34:30.043Z"
          },
          {
